<title>SOUTH AFRICA: DON STILL IN TALKS, CAUTIONS HOLDERS.</title>
<headline>DON STILL IN TALKS, CAUTIONS HOLDERS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Don Group Ltd said on Thursday, referring to earlier cautioneries, that talks were still in progress which could impact on its share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to exercise caution in their dealings until a further announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
